faqsText:
Is Faisal Town Block C in Phase 1? | Yes. This page refers to Faisal Town Phase 1/F-18 Block C.

Where is Faisal Town Block C located? | Block C is positioned near Faisal Town Gate 2 on the Rawalpindi-Kohat Road and connects with the wider Phase 1 road network.

What plot sizes are available in Block C? | Residential sizes commonly include 5, 8, 10 and 14 marla as well as 1 kanal.

What is the size of a 5-marla plot in Block C? | Current Phase 1 material commonly describes the 5-marla category as approximately 25 x 50.

What is the size of a 10-marla plot in Block C? | The 10-marla category is commonly described as approximately 35 x 70.

What is the current price of a 5-marla plot in Block C? | Recent portal price-index data placed 5-marla residential plots around PKR 12.35 million, but actual asking prices vary by street, position, dues and condition. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}

What is the current price of a 10-marla plot in Block C? | August 2026 portal price-index data placed 10-marla residential plots around PKR 20.02 million. This is a market indicator rather than an official fixed rate. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}

Are houses available for sale in Block C? | Yes. Current property portals show active house inventory, including 5-marla homes and other built properties. :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}

Is Block C good for investment? | It may suit some investors because it has an established resale market and several plot-size categories, but the entry price, location, dues and future resale demand should be evaluated for the exact property.

Should I compare Block C with Block A and Block B? | Yes. Compare the same plot size, exact street, access, possession and total payable amount before choosing.
